#. finger on their own cell; on a keyboard they hold the E key: keep the
#. letter e. About 45 characters at most.
#: game/normal/normal_mode.gd
msgid "a sense grew · hold your body to place it"
msgstr ""

#. A notice in 18 px type, for seven seconds, when the cell has grown a new
#. sense (a gene waiting for a place on its body). "Place it" means choose
